 *.PICT)<br><br><strong>VIDEO EXTENSIONS:</strong><br>MOV (*.mov, *.qt, *.hevc)<br>MPEG4 (*.mp4, *.mpeg4, *.m4v, *.h264)<br>AVI (*.avi)<br>WMV (*.wmv)<br><br><strong>OTHER EXTENSIONS:</strong> <br>Audio (*.mp3, *.wav)<br>Contacts (*.vcf) </p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-bDoQz ePRCXj pf-606_"><button type="button" class="sc-ecPDsT llrNCN pf-607_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="e0bd7fb9-1984-488c-9b8e-20e25bd86ded" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Does ThePhotoStick® Omni X need to install anything on my computer?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="e0bd7fb9-1984-488c-9b8e-20e25bd86ded" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-gdyfxU jMJlUQ pf-609_"><div class="sc-fBWQee eTKFIf pf-610_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-611_"><p class="sc-erUUlO dcvJTZ pf-612_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">{{ section.settings.pf_0f9a3504_value }}</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-bDoQz ePRCXj pf-614_"><button type="button" class="sc-ecPDsT llrNCN pf-615_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="7fd5815c-36c5-4f89-9a82-1a27bc79b707" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Can I use ThePhotoStick® Omni X as an ongoing backup solution?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="7fd5815c-36c5-4f89-9a82-1a27bc79b707" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-gdyfxU jMJlUQ pf-617_"><div class="sc-fBWQee eTKFIf pf-618_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-619_"><p class=